        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Read a Clip's Frame Rate\n\nReads a video's frame rate from its header without decoding the frames. Run it before deciding whether a clip needs converting to match the rest of an edit.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Clip\" input goes to \"Frame rate\", which reads the rate from the file metadata. \"FPS\" shows the number. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Load a phone clip and a screen recording one after the other and compare their rates."
        },
